{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pack </strong>toys. <strong>Ship </strong>orders. <strong>Finish </strong>the shift. And repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It sounds simple \u2014 until the warehouse stops feeling empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You took a night job at a quiet warehouse, hoping for easy money. What seemed like a simple packing job slowly reveals something much darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861210/extras/fefecb255c2ffaf756efb9f883f9dc80.poster.avif?t=1752688037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861210/extras/fefecb255c2ffaf756efb9f883f9dc80.webm?t=1752688037\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861210/extras/fefecb255c2ffaf756efb9f883f9dc80.mp4?t=1752688037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddea Demo Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately <strong>10\u201315 minutes of gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core <strong>toy packing</strong> and <strong>order shipping</strong> mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration of the <strong>warehouse environment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One early <strong>paranormal encounter</strong> to set the tone for the full horror experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861210/extras/1e87dc3d4e2802fe0c71dfe055d91196.poster.avif?t=1752688037\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861210/extras/1e87dc3d4e28